      "body": "## Motivation\n\n`prewarm_mhc_pre` sizes its token buckets from `chunked_prefill_size`. With `--chunked-prefill-size -1` (chunked prefill disabled) that produces a single bucket of `-1` tokens, so `residual.new_zeros(-1, ...)` raises while weights load. DeepSeek V4 cannot start with chunked prefill disabled.\n\nServers that capture prefill hidden states turn chunked prefill off, so a request's states arrive in one forward. They hit this on DeepSeek V4.\n\n## Modifications\n\nWhen chunked prefill is disabled or unset, size the prewarm buckets from `max_prefill_tokens`, which bounds a prefill batch in that case. This is the same rule `pre_capture_activation_reserve_mb` uses.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable: startup-only change. No kernel or forward code changed.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable: startup-only change.\n\n## Tests\n\nNo unit test: removed per review. The fallback cases (`-1` / `0` / `None` chunked prefill) were exercised by a since-removed CPU test that failed without the fix and passed with it.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests). Removed per review.\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations). Not applicable.\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed). Not applicable.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38649261139](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38649261139)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38649261240](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38649261240)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38649261159](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38649261159)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
